        "A university defends its results portal with layers: web application filtering at the edge, denial of service protection from the upstream ISP, segmented zones for portal, database and admin network, nightly offline backups of the database, and a documented incident channel to ngCERT. Each layer answers a named attack from this section, and mapping them is how {S} students should structure such answers.",
