        "Commissioning proves the build: certify the cabling, check switch configurations against the design, run VLAN reachability matrices, test firewall policy from each zone, pull links to prove failover, and measure performance against the bandwidth plan. Document results, snapshot configurations and train operators before handover. Acceptance criteria written during design make this phase objective rather than argumentative, which is how mature {S} projects finish.",
