        "Portfolio value: a student who can show a documented small-office design, address plan, zone diagram, policy, budget and test results holds interview-ready evidence of competence. Employers at ISPs, banks and fintechs ask candidates to sketch such designs on whiteboards, and the same drill repeats inside professional certifications. Keep every artefact dated and signed off, as {S} portfolios should be.",
